\h
\h
\h
\h
\h
\h
\h


00:17:35.510 --> 00:17:36.480
Hey!

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.380
Are you okay?

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:42.780
C-Comrade.

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:46.780
Trade places with me and take this to Niigata Harbor.

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:51.750
Our foreign comrades are waiting at the central wharf.

00:17:58.060 --> 00:18:01.120
I'm not your comrade, but I'm kind of in a hurry...

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:03.060
so lend me this for a little while, okay?

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:06.230
Once I've taken care of business, I'll bring it to the harbor.

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:19.580
This is pretty much the same as the ones I use at work!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.430
Noa! At worst, this is gonna be 3-on-1!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.000
If you're scared, trade with Ota!

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:15.060
Instead of consolation money, get me two premiere movie tickets.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:17.340
Go see it with me once we get back to Tokyo.

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:18.410
Roger!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:32.460
Trailer 2, raise your deck and block the road!

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:43.830
The SV2's Second Unit has taken custody of this Labor!

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:48.110
Thank you for your cooperation. Well done.

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:52.240
We'll wrap things up here, so please withdraw.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:55.450
I warn you that further involvement will constitute...

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:59.750
interference in the performance of official duties.

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:04.950
Oh. You're going to try it, anyway. Officer Izumi? Take them on.

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:07.020
Don't worry about the Brocken.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:09.360
In a straight-out slugfest, those guys have the edge.

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:10.430
Use your edge in speed!

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:12.990
Hey, that's easier said than done!

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:22.670
Smartass!

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:33.040
You're under arrest...

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:35.750
for interfering in the performance of official duties...

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:37.250
as well as destruction of public property!

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:39.210
Not too shabby.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:41.760
It's not time for that yet! Behind you!

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:51.960
Get up, Noa! Get up! Noa!

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:00.840
Noa!

00:21:01.880 --> 00:21:04.480
Asuma!

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:17.690
I'm the kind of guy who repays his debts.

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:26.760
You...

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:28.600
You hurt my...

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:32.740
You hurt my Pattie!

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:35.680
Clothesline!

00:22:00.140 --> 00:22:04.040
Plump and sound asleep.

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:09.980
Thank God. Thank God you're okay.

00:22:10.380 --> 00:22:15.880
When I called last night, I... I...

00:22:23.830 --> 00:22:25.590
What's going to happen to him?

00:22:26.200 --> 00:22:27.170
Who?

00:22:27.270 --> 00:22:31.030
Wasn't the guy driving that semi and piloting that Brocken...

00:22:31.140 --> 00:22:33.900
somebody named Yu'ichi Moritomo?

00:22:36.340 --> 00:22:39.000
Nobody knows about that guy in there.

00:22:39.110 --> 00:22:41.640
If we wipe the monitor records from Unit 1...

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:43.840
there won't be any trace of him at all.

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:45.580
But Moritomo will talk!

00:22:45.780 --> 00:22:47.580
Who are they going to believe?

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:51.550
The word of the Second Unit's captain or that of a criminal?

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:53.860
Unbelievable.

00:22:53.960 --> 00:22:55.790
You know that's illegal.

00:22:56.360 --> 00:22:58.850
He should get a medal for what he did!

00:22:58.960 --> 00:23:02.020
We found out about all this because of him.

00:23:02.640 --> 00:23:05.600
How could we arrest him?

00:23:09.810 --> 00:23:13.140
I didn't <i>see</i> anything, I didn't <i>hear</i> anything.

00:23:16.020 --> 00:23:18.070
Hey, why don't you go see the baby?

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:21.680
Oh, right.

00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:28.380
Forget it.

00:23:30.530 --> 00:23:31.660
Ah.

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:48.110
SV Units, go North!
